@@ -378,6 +378,13 @@
 .Ev PKG_REFCOUNT_DBDIR
 are prefixed with
 .Ar destdir .
+A nested invocation that inherits
+.Ev PKG_DESTDIR
+and
+.Ev PKG_REFCOUNT_DBDIR
+from a package script and uses the same destination treats the inherited
+reference-count directory as already rooted.
+Package scripts can perform arbitrary actions; this option does not isolate them.
 .Sh ENVIRONMENT
 See
 .Xr pkg_install.conf 5
